OL,3,GNEWSAFire tackled at fly-tipped waste
OL,4,Asite
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews have tackled a blaze at a
OL,7,Fformer factory site where about 400
OL,8,Ftonnes of rubbish was previously
OL,9,Fdumped.
OL,11,FCounty Durham and Darlington Fire and
OL,12,FRescue (CDDFRS) was called to the old
OL,13,FDewhirst site in Peterlee at about
OL,14,F07:15 BST, where according to crews, a
OL,15,Flarge quantity of fly-tipped rubbish
OL,16,Fwas "well alight".
OL,18,FThe Environment Agency (EA) had
OL,19,Fpreviously launched an investigation
OL,20,Fafter industrial waste was dumped there
OL,21,Fin July.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,448,440,260,160,0,100
