OL,3,GNEWSAFire tackled at fly-tipped waste
OL,4,Asite
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne fire engine from Peterlee Fire
OL,7,FStation attended, with crews
OL,8,Fextinguishing the flames and leaving
OL,9,Fthe scene just before 08:00.
